<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first leg matches in</p>
<p>the men's EuroLeague basketball elimination round on Thursday:</p>
<p>In Istanbul: Efes Pilsen (Turkey) 76 Maccabi Tel Aviv</p>
<p>(Israel) 67.</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Efes Pilsen - Sarica 20, Karasev 15</p>
<p>Maccabi Elite - Johnson 18, White 15</p>
<p>In Berlin: Alba Berlin (Germnay) 77 FC Barcelona (Spain) 95</p>
<p>(41-53)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Alba Berlin - Wendell Alexis 25, Henning Harnisch 13</p>
<p>FC Barcelona - Andres Jimenez 19, Javier Fernandez 15,</p>
<p>Roberto Duenas 13</p>
<p>In Milan: Stefanel Milan (Italy) 67 Kinder Bologna (Italy)</p>
<p>59 (halftime 37-28).</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Stefanel - Gregor Fucka 23, Anthony Bowie 10, Flavio</p>
<p>Portaluppi 10, Alessandro De Pol 10</p>
<p>Kinder - Kostas Patavoukas 16, Zoran Savic 12, Alessandro</p>
<p>Abbio 11</p>
<p>Attendance - 5,000</p>
<p>In Zagreb: Cibona Zagreb (Croatia) 61  Smelt Olimpija</p>
<p>(Slovenia) 58 (29-29)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Cibona: Damir Mulaomerovic 21, Djevad Alihodzic 12, Evgeny</p>
<p>Kissourine 10.</p>
<p>Olimpija: Henrie 14, Milic 13, Kraljevic 8.</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000.</p>
</text>
